[Desktop Entry]
Name=Hearth GNOME
Comment=Hearth OS: Game Mode and the Hearth GNOME desktop (GNOME Shell in Hearth's look). Saved as your desktop; falls back to Hearth Classic if GNOME can't start.
Exec=/usr/local/bin/nimbus-session --desktop=gnome
TryExec=gnome-shell
Type=Application
DesktopNames=Nimbus
